  "content_html": "<div class=\"post-body entry-content\" id=\"post-body-5724564731544179084\" itemprop=\"description articleBody\">\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\" trbidi=\"on\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 22.5pt; margin-right: 18.0pt; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: center; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<br/></div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0cm 22.5pt; text-align: center; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><b><u><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>تطبيق خرائط كشف\nالزحام على الأيفون</span></u></b><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>:<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0.0001pt 22.5pt; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><br/></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0.0001pt 22.5pt; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> برنامج ملاحي <u>مجاني</u> مع خريطة طرق محدثة\nومعلومات عن <u>الإزدحام المروري</u>. \nالتطبيق من أنتاج شركة </span></b><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>TomTom</span></b><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><b><span style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><span dir=\"RTL\"></span><span dir=\"RTL\"></span> <span lang=\"AR-SA\">العالمية المعروفة و يغطي\nالخبر والظهران والدمام الى راس تنورة.</span></span></b><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><br/>\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br/>\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0.0001pt 22.5pt; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>خريطة تظهر اشارات\nمباشرة لمواقع الازدحام ، برنامج حلو و مفيد و اهم شي انه مجاني بالبحث عنه في ابل ستور باسم (طريقي) او </span></b><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span> (Tareeqi )</span></b><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>او اضغط هذا الرابط</span></b><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><b><span dir=\"LTR\" lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span> </span></b><span class=\"apple-converted-space\"><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'> </span></b></span><span dir=\"LTR\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi;'><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/sa/app/epm-traffic-tryqy/id732804721?mt=8\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span dir=\"RTL\" lang=\"AR-SA\" style=\"background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; color: windowtext;\">طريقي</span></b></a></span><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi;'>.<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0.0001pt 22.5pt; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><br/></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"direction: rtl; margin: 0cm 18pt 0.0001pt 22.5pt; unicode-bidi: embed;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: black;\"><b><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'>بعد تحميل التطبيق\nو فتح الخريطة راح تشوف صورة سيارة في اسفل متصفح الخريطة. اذا ضغطت عليها بتطلع\nمواقع الازدحام المروري. والتطبيق ممكن نستعمله في الجي بي اس</span></b><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><b><span dir=\"LTR\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16pt;'><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span>.</span></b></span><b style=\"background-color: white;\"><span lang=\"AR-SA\" style='background: #F5F5FF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\",\"serif\"; font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi;'><o:p></o:p></span></b></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"background-color: white; background-position: initial initial; b